# Everything in this repository is LF, in the index and in the working tree on
# every platform. The build is exercised on both WSL and MSVC, and the vendored
# Sail model is a 280k-line generated artifact regenerated by
# scripts/fix_cpp_model.py — a host-dependent line ending there turns a
# three-line patch into a four-thousand-line diff, flipped back again by the
# next run on the other OS. The script pins LF on its own writes; this pins it
# for every other way a file can reach the index.
#
# Nothing tracked here needs CRLF (no .bat/.cmd/.sln), and every text file is
# already LF, so this normalises nothing retroactively.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The compressed model is byte-exact: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.gz binary
